# Redis caching

- Cache-aside only. Do not cache every HTTP request.
- Use `CachePort`. Do not inject Redis into controllers or domain entities.
- Define key conventions and TTL. Invalidate explicitly on writes.
- Redis failures must not block database-backed reads.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/implement-caching/SKILL.md`.
